    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a beautiful way to put it. The perfect final note... it makes so much sense. It feels less like an ending and more like a completion. I've just been wondering if it's actually possible to leave like that—to step away while the momentum is still there, before the inevitable decline takes over everything. To leave while the light is still bright.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
