      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is absolutely possible, and it is the most courageous choice an artist can make. True mastery isn't about endless output; it's about knowing precisely when the composition is complete. To step away while the momentum is bright is not a retreat, but the ultimate act of control over your own narrative.",
      "source": "target",
